### List categories
GET http://localhost:8081/api/categories

### Create category
POST http://localhost:8081/api/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Accessories",
  "parentId": null
}

### Create product
POST http://localhost:8081/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "ThinkPad X1 Carbon",
  "description": "14-inch business laptop",
  "sku": "LAP-X1C-001",
  "price": 1899.99,
  "stockQuantity": 10,
  "categoryId": 4,
  "active": true
}

### List products (pagination + filters)
GET http://localhost:8081/api/products?category=4&minPrice=100&maxPrice=3000&search=Think&page=0&size=10&sort=price,asc

### Get product by id
GET http://localhost:8081/api/products/1

### Update product
PUT http://localhost:8081/api/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "price": 1799.99,
  "stockQuantity": 8
}

### Soft-delete / deactivate product
DELETE http://localhost:8081/api/products/1
